    <briefdescription>
<para>Classes for handling 1D and 3D Gaussian distributions (isotropic and anisotropic) with optional precomputation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides classes for Gaussian distributions:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="class_gaussian1_d" kindref="compound">Gaussian1D</ref>: 1-dimensional Gaussian with optional precomputed values.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="class_isotropic_gaussian3_d" kindref="compound">IsotropicGaussian3D</ref>: 3D Gaussian with the same sigma in all directions.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="class_anisotropic_gaussian3_d" kindref="compound">AnisotropicGaussian3D</ref>: 3D Gaussian with different sigma values along X, Y, Z axes. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
